# Ignore everything...
*

# ... except the examples and the standalone test programs
!examples/
!examples/**
!pco_camera_clock_drift_profiling/
!pco_camera_clock_drift_profiling/**
!pco_camera_resync_test/
!pco_camera_resync_test/**

# But ignore all build files even if they're under the folders above
examples/**/build/
pco_camera_clock_drift_profiling/**/build/
pco_camera_clock_drift_profiling/**/.pio/
pco_camera_resync_test/**/build/
pco_camera_resync_test/**/.pio/
# ... and the recordings and analysis output of the tests
pco_camera_clock_drift_profiling/**/clock_drift_*/
pco_camera_clock_drift_profiling/**/raw_capture_*/
pco_camera_resync_test/**/resync_test_*/

# Finally, don't ignore this .gitignore file
!.gitignore